<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Qwest Communications.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Qwest Communications.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist Thursday raised its September quarter earnings estimate for Qwest Communications Inc to $0.21 a share from $0.13 a share and its revenue estimate to $193.9 million from $178.2 million.</p>
<p>-- said the company &quot;has begun to fulfill the exceptional promise of its strong business plan, talented management team and network buildout strategy.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Qwest shares were up 2-1/4 at 37-1/8 by mid-afternoon.</p>
</text>
